  "title": "Chocolate Cherry Chip Cake",
  "description": "We always called it the &#34;Busy Cake&#34;...too many things going on with it! Crushed maraschino cherries can be found in the ice cream sundae department at the grocery store. If you can&#39;t find them, get regular maraschino cherries and chop.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle C Williams"
  ],
